      "description": {
        "fun": "A mischievous ball of plasma that slips inside electrical appliances and takes them over, often to play pranks. Moving into a microwave, washing machine, fridge, electric fan or lawn mower turns it into Heat, Wash, Frost, Fan or Mow Rotom, each with a new type. Some Rotom put the habit to good use, powering the Rotom Pokédex and the Rotom Phone.",
        "guide": "Rotom is an Electric- and Ghost-type Pokémon with a body of plasma that can enter electrical appliances. Possessing a microwave, washing machine, refrigerator, fan or lawn mower changes its form and second type. Its name is 'motor' spelled backwards.",
